543 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (According to Duggal \(2024\). Kevin Ashton created the phrase "Internet of Things" \(IoT\) in 1999. But it was not until Gartner added IoT to its list of new emerging technologies in 2011 that it began to garner worldwide traction. As of 2021, the globe had 21.7 billion active connected devices, with IoT devices accounting for more than 11.7 billion \(54 percent\). This signifies that the globe has more IoT devices than non-IoT devices . )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [2]
>>
